# Prompt 9 — Final Product Polish

Give BugPilot AI a final hackathon-ready polish pass.

Do not add major features.

Improve only:
- Visual consistency
- Empty state
- Loading state
- Error state
- Button states
- Code readability
- Spacing
- Responsive behavior
- Accessibility
- Copy feedback
- Form validation messages

Ensure:
- The main action is immediately obvious.
- A first-time user understands what to enter.
- Results are easy to scan.
- Long code does not break the layout.
- The interface remains minimal.
- The product name and purpose are immediately clear.

Remove placeholder text, lorem ipsum, debug controls, console logs, and unfinished UI.

Run a production build and fix any issues.
